Prepared, NOT applied. Applies only after the PO decides T11 (see plans/claude-session-2026-10-12.md).
Measures the helper after CRLF->LF normalization so the LF blob pin holds on a CRLF checkout
(.gitattributes:18 `*.ps1 text eol=crlf`); the executed script text is the measured, normalized text.
A regression test (CRLF working copy accepted, any other byte change still refused) goes with it.

